"description":"Block ads in Safari — including YouTube. Stop trackers and protect your privacy with advanced DNS filtering. Free to use. Trusted by millions.\n\nBROWSE SAFARI WITHOUT DISTRACTION\nBlock banners, popups, autoplay videos, and intrusive ads in Safari — including YouTube — free and without limitations.\nClean up websites and stay focused on the content you actually came for.\n\nBLOCK TRACKING. PROTECT YOUR PRIVACY\nStop hidden tracking scripts and digital fingerprints used by companies to track your activity.\nProtect your privacy while browsing and prevent personal data collection.\n\nFASTER LOADING. LESS DATA USAGE\nImprove page loading speed by removing ads and heavy scripts.\nSave mobile data and battery life when browsing, streaming, or using limited plans or roaming.\n\nDNS PROTECTION BEYOND SAFARI\nEncrypted DNS filtering blocks annoyances and unwanted requests system-wide — not just in Safari — and keeps your DNS queries private from ISPs, networks, and third parties watching your traffic. \nSecure your connection on public Wi-Fi. Use family-safe DNS to filter adult content on a child's device.\n\nFREE TO USE — WITH PRO FEATURES\nFree forever: Safari ad blocking + basic privacy protection. No account or registration required.\nPro unlocks: advanced YouTube blocking, app protection via DNS, custom rules + security filters.\n7-day free trial — upgrade seamlessly right from your live stats dashboard.\n\nSEE THE DEFENSES IN ACTION\nMonitor blocked ads and trackers with built-in statistics.\nView protection status and monitoring data in real time.\n\nFULL CONTROL WITH CUSTOM SETTINGS\n- Customize allowlists and blocklists\n- Choose DNS servers\n- Create user rules for filtering\n\nPOWERFUL FILTERING TECHNOLOGY\nAdvanced in-house filters and other popular filter lists.\nIncludes protection against malvertising, phishing, and suspicious content.\n\nTRUSTED AND TRANSPARENT\n17 years of experience in ad blocking.\nFully open source on GitHub — inspect every line of code. No \"acceptable ads\" programs, no compromises.\n\nUSE SAFARI THE WAY IT SHOULD BE\nCleaner pages, fewer distractions, and better privacy.\nAdGuard for iOS gives you control over Safari browsing and DNS protection.\n\nPrivacy policy: https://adguard.com/privacy.html\nTerms of use: https://adguard.com/eula.html\nFollow us on X @AdGuard\nFacebook: facebook.com/AdGuardEn/\nSupport: support@adguard.com", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.35113000000000038625103115919046103954315185546875, "sellerUrl":"https://adguard.com/", 
